Route the external Waybar dashboard button through Wayle's existing GTK
application action D-Bus interface instead of the custom Shell1 property relay.
The action is executed on GTK's main thread and toggles the already-created
native dashboard popover directly.  A small `wayle panel dashboard` CLI command
keeps the Waybar configuration simple and uses the same proven action transport
as `wayle panel inspect`.

